        question: "How do I decide which capital gains reduction strategy is right for me?",
        answer:
          "The right strategy depends on your full financial picture, including whether you want to remain in real estate, your income for the year of sale, and your sale timeline flexibility. Modeling the after tax outcome of each option against your actual basis and income is the recommended starting point.",
